le-Main-Profile-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"A man in a suit and purple tie sits in front of a colorful mural featuring cartoon characters, showcasing the unique artistic flair of Dericole C.\" itemprop=\"image\" height=\"300\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" width=\"300\" title=\"A man in a suit and purple tie sits in front of a colorful mural featuring cartoon characters, showcasing the unique artistic flair of Dericole C.\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t<h3><a href=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/dericole-c/\">Dericole C.</a></h3>\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/dj-anikan\"  target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"  itemprop=\"url\">\n\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/3a6734ea-8170-43a5-bc5e-61dd2e86135f-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"Man in a blue shirt, hat, and headphones leans against a wall with blue graffiti art, embodying the cool confidence of professional DJs.\" itemprop=\"image\" height=\"300\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" width=\"300\" title=\"Man in a blue shirt, hat, and headphones leans against a wall with blue graffiti art, embodying the cool confidence of professional DJs.\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t<h3><a href=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/dj-anikan/\">DJ Anikan</a></h3>\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/dj-voncile/\"  target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"  itemprop=\"url\">\n\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/IMG_20240109_1543485003-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20240109_154348500~3\" itemprop=\"image\" height=\"300\" width=\"300\" title=\"IMG_20240109_154348500~3\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t<h3><a href=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/dj-voncil/\">DJ Voncil</a></h3>\n\n"
